入 `github:123caiji/"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"dsh-memory-toolkit`\n5. 选择要加载的子包"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### 验证安装"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nbash"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"# 设置环境变量（DeepSeek Embedding API 示例）\nsetx GRAPH_MEMORY_EMBEDDING_API_KEY \"your-api-key\"\nsetx GRAPH_ME"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"MORY_EMBEDDING_BASE_URL \"https://api.deepseek.com/v1\"\nsetx GRAPH_MEMORY_EMBEDDING_MODEL \"text-embedd"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"ing-v1\"\nsetx GRAPH_MEMORY_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS \"1024\""},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nyaml\n- insert:\n- id: graph-memory\nname: '@123caiji/dsh-graph-memory'\nconfig:\ndbPath: /y"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"our/custom/path/graph-memory.db"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nbash"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"# 调用 context_audit 工具审计上下文 token 成本\ncontext_audit(cwd=\".\")"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nbash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:labmimors/dsh-mcp-lens          # 收敛层\ndsh plug"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"in --profile web add github:tianji-qingtian/dsh-model-router # 路由层\ndsh plugin --profile web add gith"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"ub:TT-Wang/dsh-slice-agent-loop     # 重建层（高风险，单独验证）"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nyaml"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"# ~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml\n- insert:\n- id: graph-memory\nname: '@123caiji/dsh-graph-memor"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"y'\nconfig:\nrecallMaxNodes: 10        # 召回最大节点数（默认 6）\nrecallMaxDepth: 3         # 召回深度（默认 2）\nmaintena"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"nceInterval: 12   # 维护周期（小时，默认 6）"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- id: lean-context\nname: '@123caiji/dsh-lean-context'\nconfig:\ndiscipline:\nenabled: true\naudit:\nenabl"},{"id":"p48s2","text":"ed: true\ncacheSeconds: 120\nconvergence:\nenabled: true             # 需先安装 dsh-mcp-lens\nrouting:\nenabl"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"ed: false\nrebuild:\nenabled: false            # 高风险，默认关"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nbash\ngit clone https://github.com/123caiji/dsh-memory-toolkit.git\ncd dsh-memory-toolkit"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"bash\ngit clone https://github.com/123caiji/dsh-memory-toolkit.git\ncd dsh-memory-toolkit\npnpm install"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"# 构建\npnpm run build"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"# 测试\npnpm run test"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"# 单个包\npnpm --filter @123caiji/dsh-graph-memory run build\npnpm --filter @123caiji/dsh-lean-context ru"},{"id":"p52s2","text":"pnpm --filter @123caiji/dsh-graph-memory run build\npnpm --filter @123caiji/dsh-lean-context run test"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"dsh-memory-toolkit/\n├── package.json                 # workspace 根\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml\n├── LICEN"},{"id":"p54s2","text":"SE                      # MIT\n├── README.md                     # 本文件\n├── .gitignore\n└── packages/\n├"},{"id":"p54s3","text":"── graph-memory/             # 跨会话知识图谱记忆 (5,813 行 TS)\n│   ├── package.json\n│   ├── cordis.patch.yml "},{"id":"p54s4","text":"     # DSH 插件注册\n│   ├── dsh.ts                # DSH 工具注册入口 (428 行)\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"### 上游插件（可选依赖）"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"| 插件 | 用途 | 仓库 |"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"| dsh-mcp-lens | MCP 工具 schema 收敛 | `labmimors/dsh-mcp-lens` |\n| dsh-model-router | 模型路由 | `tianji-q"},{"id":"p57s2","text":"ingtian/dsh-model-router` |\n| dsh-slice-agent-loop | Agent Loop 切片重建 | `TT-Wang/dsh-slice-agent-loop"},{"id":"p57s3","text":"tian/dsh-model-router` |\n| dsh-slice-agent-loop | Agent Loop 切片重建 | `TT-Wang/dsh-slice-agent-loop` |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
